# Paths the image build never needs.
#
# The build installs its own dependency tree from the lock file and builds its
# own output, so a copy of either one would slow the build and reach the image
# with the wrong architecture.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
local
test-results
e2e-results
.turbo
.git
.env
.env.*
*.log
